  "derivation": "The two43px rows use the same cross-subgrid first/last baseline groups as the continuous case: first-row child offsets16/0, last-row offsets30/14. Each row fits exactly one frame; the7px inter-row gap is discarded at the unforced break under the existing minimal-distortion Grid fragmentation policy. Rectangles are world coordinates at frame origins(5,7) and(11,70). Each subgrid and its child is published only on its owning row frame. Grid2 section13 does not uniquely prescribe all fragment distributions.",
